# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local machine state and reference checkouts. Never committed.
#
# Note: gitignore does NOT support trailing comments on a pattern line, so every
# comment here lives on its own line. A trailing "# ..." becomes part of the
# pattern and silently matches nothing.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.tools/
.home/
node_modules/
_ref/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and signing material. Never committed, never printed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.local
secrets/
signature/
*.p12
*.cer
*.p7b
*.keystore
*.jks
.ohos-system-signing/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DevEco Studio / hvigor / ohpm / OpenHarmony build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/build/
**/.hvigor/
**/.cxx/
**/oh_modules/
**/.preview/
**/.clangd
**/.clang-format
**/.clang-tidy
*.har
*.hsp
*.hap

# ...except the signed artefact, which is a required deliverable and belongs in the
# repository so a judge can install it without building anything first.
!dist/*.hap

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Downloaded installers. The DevEco Studio image is several gigabytes; a file
# like this must never enter git history, because it cannot be removed cleanly
# afterwards.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.crdownload
*.download
*.dmg
*.pkg
*.msi
DevEco*.zip
command-line-tools*.zip

# Large toolchain archives fetched from the public OpenHarmony mirror.
# They are reproducible from the mirror URL, so they do not belong in git.
.downloads/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
*.log

# Offline signing work directory (generated certificates and the signed HAP).
app/.signing/

# Remotion demo: dependencies and the captured frames are regenerated by
# scripts/capture-demo-stills.sh, so only the composition and the finished video
# belong in git.
demo/node_modules/
demo/out/*
# ...except the finished video, which is a required deliverable and belongs in the
# repository so a judge can watch it without rendering anything first.
!demo/out/bridge-demo.mp4
